---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/arrivals-cumulative-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/arrivals-cumulative-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="Four roles against our busiest single posting"
  caption="The 816 line combines all four roles from the hour they went live; each comparison line is a single earlier posting, with typical near the median."
>
  Line chart of applications received over the first 32 hours after posting. These four roles together reach 816. Our busiest earlier posting, a single role, reached 382 in its busiest 32 hours. A typical earlier posting reached 36.
</Chart>
